(f) striking ‘‘the Director of the Federal Emergency Management Agency ’’ 
in section 2(d)(1) and inserting ‘‘the Secretary of Homeland Security ’’ in 
lieu thereof; 
(g) striking ‘‘Federal Emergency Management Agency.

